  m_text: 'The gray bars in the background represent probability of rolling the numbers 2 through 12 with two dice. 7 is the most common roll with two dice, because there are more combinations that add up to 7 than any other number. Some spikes and gaps are normal, especially in the Rolling History for a single game. To view the full Rolling History for all games played, tap Stats from the Main Menu and then Dice Stats.

'
